@dmulcahey  If you compare how deconz handles state vs how zha handles it, you can see that deconz updates the full device state using supplied arguments while zha only changes state of supplied arguments, leaving rest of the state unchanged. Zha should reset or unset state attributes that are not passed to the turn_on function.

[Deconz function ](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/blob/dev/homeassistant/components/deconz/light.py#L162)
[ZHA function](https://github.com/home-assistant/core/blob/dev/homeassistant/components/zha/light.py#L192)
